\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-review-queue.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Taxonomy node candidates: 12\n- Edge label candidates: 7\n- Accepted canonical node representatives: 5\n- Obvious duplicate node merges: 1\n- Explicit no-merge decisions: 2\n- Ambiguous node reviews: 2\n- Edge-label duplicate decisions: 2\n- Edge-label reviews: 1\n- Unresolved review tasks: 3\n- Generated labels without provenance accepted: 0\n\n## Issue Readback\n\nLive #1321 is open under parent #1313. Parent #1313's revised order places #1321 before #1320/#1318, so the stale SEM-KG-HVY-06 dependency is encoded as a stale dependency override instead of blocking this gate.\n\nThis PR does not run full generation, external model/API calls, remote Supabase mutation, frontend work, or production RAG reindexing.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.mjs` -> validator `pass`; 12 taxonomy node candidates, 7 edge-label candidates, 3 unresolved review tasks.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-taxonomy-contract.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-gold-adversarial-fixtures.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.test.js` -> 3 suites passed, 20 tests passed.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-taxonomy-canonicalization-dedupe-gate.test.js` -> passed.\n- `npm run lint:changed` -> passed; no changed `.js/.jsx` files to lint.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> exit 0; top status `warning` only for branch naming/ownership, with clean worktree, upstream synced, report/artifact guard healthy, and A+ ratchet healthy.\n\nCommit: e5db19a3e314f3ea5b5543cf668083aead65cdcf\n\nCloses #1321\n","created_at":"2026-07-05T20:24:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T20:35:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T20:35:07Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T20:35:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"b9f45904bca35bd85e59f786cde9ca6b35218aef","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1344/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1344/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1344/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/61d1bc9bfa4e6bd58ea76fb75a515a379594aa2e","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1321","ref":"feat/issue-1321","sha":"61d1bc9bfa4e6bd58ea76fb75a515a379594aa2e","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.gith